      "quoteEn": "Shriji Maharaj explained: ‘A person with the highest level of nirvikalp faith realizes that the countless millions of brahmands appear like mere atoms before Akshar, the abode of Purushottam Narayan. He identifies himself with that Akshar and offers upasana to Purushottam.’",
